DROP SCHEMA IF EXISTS `ofm-b2s-data-dev.sbx_gold_merchandise`    CASCADE;
DROP SCHEMA IF EXISTS `ofm-b2s-data-dev.sbx_gold_supply_chain`   CASCADE;
DROP SCHEMA IF EXISTS `ofm-b2s-data-dev.sbx_gold_phms`           CASCADE;
DROP SCHEMA IF EXISTS `ofm-b2s-data-dev.sbx_gold_finance`        CASCADE;
DROP SCHEMA IF EXISTS `ofm-b2s-data-dev.sbx_gold_marketing`      CASCADE;
DROP SCHEMA IF EXISTS `ofm-b2s-data-dev.sbx_utility`             CASCADE;
